.DS_Store
.env

# Compiled binaries produced by `go build ./cmd/...` at the repo root.
# Listed explicitly rather than by a wildcard: these two names shadow the
# cmd/ package directories they are built from, so a bare pattern risks
# ignoring source. Keep in sync with cmd/.
/control-plane
/sandbox-agent

# Web UI build output (§12.1): `make web-build`/`vite build` writes directly
# here -- see web/vite.config.ts's own comment for why the frontend
# bundler's outDir points inside this Go package instead of the more
# conventional web/dist (go:embed's directive syntax forbids a `..`
# upward-traversal pattern, so the embed target in
# internal/adapters/inbound/webui/assets_embed.go cannot live under web/
# without either this, or a separate copy step this avoids entirely). Never
# committed -- a build artifact, like /control-plane and /sandbox-agent
# above.
/internal/adapters/inbound/webui/dist
